{"id":"n67517-2-7","stage":4,"title":"엎다 · 洒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67517-2-7-1","ko":"바닥에 왜 이렇게 물이 흥건하니?","zh":"地上怎么会有这么多水啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바닥에","meaning":"地板","explanation":"바닥：地板；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닥","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62696","senseId":"4","lemma":"바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닥에","audio":"/audio/2a0877f2b7ca0b120f73.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물이","audio":"/audio/bbb693e9d07d2f260739.mp3"}},{"text":"흥건하니?","meaning":"水漫，满","explanation":"흥건하다：水漫，满；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"흥건하다","audio":"/audio/30624c81bbbf06391714.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87535","senseId":"1","lemma":"흥건하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흥건하니","audio":"/audio/1ca1f06088819d69627d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"18c3f3f4b810aab6","term":"바닥","zh":"地板","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3","entryId":"62696","definition":"建筑物内部的下面部分。","pronunciation":["바닥"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"30624c81bbbf0639","term":"흥건하다","zh":"水漫，满","audio":"/audio/30624c81bbbf06391714.mp3","entryId":"87535","definition":"水等很多，到淹没或积满的程度。","pronunciation":["흥건하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6818f579f7f42a1093f7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67517-2-7-2","ko":"죄송해요, 아까 제가 물컵을 엎었어요.","zh":"对不起，刚才我不小心打翻了水杯。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송해요,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송해요","audio":"/audio/e9f7fd1f9febb8b27ec0.mp3"}},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"물컵을","meaning":"水杯","explanation":"물컵：水杯；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물컵","audio":"/audio/059ccc3b4b126183cd44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56144","senseId":"1","lemma":"물컵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물컵을","audio":"/audio/e1bfc35d164cf22f405d.mp3"}},{"text":"엎었어요.","meaning":"洒，打翻","explanation":"엎다：洒，打翻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"엎다","audio":"/audio/38e2583fbcff61271475.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67517","senseId":"2","lemma":"엎다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엎었어요","audio":"/audio/d123ff281f80fe45d90c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"059ccc3b4b126183","term":"물컵","zh":"水杯","audio":"/audio/059ccc3b4b126183cd44.mp3","entryId":"56144","definition":"把水或饮料等倒在里面喝的杯子。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"38e2583fbcff6127","term":"엎다","zh":"洒，打翻","audio":"/audio/38e2583fbcff61271475.mp3","entryId":"67517","definition":"不小心弄倒而使里面盛着的东西被泼出来。","pronunciation":["업따"]}],"audio":"/audio/658db952eed3b322bda4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67517","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["地上怎么会有这么多水啊？","对不起，刚才我不小心打翻了水杯。","观众的反馈怎么样？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["地上怎么会有这么多水啊？","对不起，刚才我不小心打翻了水杯。","观众的反馈怎么样？"],"answer":1}]}
